{"stage": "R", "cell_id": "g2-u-robot", "group": "G2", "cap": 256, "generated_tokens": 195, "yields_incl_eos": 196, "cap_hit": false, "finish_reason": "stop", "wall_ms": 4777, "wall_ms_claim": false, "at": "2026-11-06T00:38:24+00:00", "output": "<think>\n\n</think>\n\nIn the quiet hum of a forgotten city, a robot named Lira moved through the streets, its sleek body gliding like a shadow. Lira had been built to be a companion, a guide, a helper—until one day, she found herself wandering without a destination. The city had changed, and so had she. Lira had no plans, no purpose, no end. She wandered, searching for something she had never known she needed.  \n\nShe passed through abandoned buildings, their walls whispering secrets in forgotten languages. She visited markets where the air was thick with the scent of spices and the sound of voices. She walked past parks where the trees whispered stories in a language she did not understand. And yet, she never stopped.  \n\nLira had no heart, no mind, no reason to stop. She simply moved on, and on, and on. The city changed, and so did she. Lira never looked back.", "output_sha256": "bd59507335ee3e42e8e7f7f845cc2b58d2e5ea116e3387e2a2a68b2174baead9"}
